{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e01e7cb483437605343fdef55256fcea9ffcab7c40eeaedfbd578149f8ef8eb9", "ja": "（肝試しイベントで茜が失敗をしてしまった。\nいつもなら、そんな失敗も前向きに捉える茜だが……）", "zh": "（茜在试胆活动中失败了。平时就算遇到这种失败，茜也会积极看待，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "491b2c99e027488e4821db4a6aad7985edbc625e484940579f5eae7968a94e29", "ja": "ウニャ～……茜ちゃんともあろう者が、\nこんな恥ずかしい姿を見せることになるなんて……。", "zh": "呜喵～……堂堂小茜，居然会让人看到这么丢脸的样子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "62b84105afce17e909ea79a236ad9631964b2afe6fa91e0cc1a77f44f70f568d", "ja": "リハーサルは、バッチリだったんだよ！？　けど、\n本番でちょーっとだけ、調子に乗っちゃって……。", "zh": "彩排明明进行得超顺利的啊！？可是，正式演出时稍微有那么一点得意忘形了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a98571371d6d578045631e22fd805486c85c09cfabd23c73c24d4df4003d0049", "ja": "（珍しく落ち込んでるな。今回の仕事、結構張り切って\nいたし、その分悔しさもあるのかも……よし）", "zh": "（真少见，她居然这么消沉。这次的工作她也特别卖力，可能正因为如此，才会更加不甘心吧……好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_1004", "source_sha256": "8ee6826a8efc0faeed38534e95fa04ea39e587d3fe383088f3b327133513330e", "ja": "ナデナデナデナデ！", "zh": "摸摸摸摸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2000_023aka", "source_sha256": "9c0cff8a60381c1d08a91b70b31e5e66a90bc4ebe3cdadad82dce448659b2b97", "ja": "ニャ！？　急にどうしたの？\nもしかして、茜ちゃんのこと慰めてくれてる？", "zh": "喵！？突然怎么了？\n难道是在安慰小茜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2001_p", "source_sha256": "35ef6efe232be35c35e7fe2edca5a4ef4f1583feec6a9938b3b50a2d596134b2", "ja": "まあな。茜が、みんなを喜ばせたくて考えたことだし、\n一生懸命準備してる姿も見てるしな。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟这也是茜为了让大家开心才想出来的，\n而且我也看到了你努力准备的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1803dea78a2d4ab661c826836170d3962f7463eace0013b1174bf3e72abfba87", "ja": "調子に乗ったところは、今日に限らず反省してほしいが\n……次は、気をつければいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不过，希望你别只反省今天得意忘形的地方，平时也要好好反省……下次注意就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2003_023aka", "source_sha256": "627ff5b87d6ab46440338fce7dbf02b0e595fe71608c8281678e87bc60d71a6e", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……。\nそう……そうだよね！　確かにその通りだよ！", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n对……对吧！确实就是这样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2004_023aka", "source_sha256": "fef0673a524cf05e8ccfe1d89d13faf939cb3e3c5c187c0ad32e3f3c61626a4f", "ja": "茜ちゃん、すっごーく頑張ったんだし、\nこれは限りなく成功に近い失敗ってことだよね！", "zh": "小茜都已经那么努力了，所以这算是无限接近成功的失败，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2005_023aka", "source_sha256": "a4a2b9147e87886c50dfd2af24e40555d7f9514b99af8c255516cbca8c27be2c", "ja": "というか、いつまでも落ち込んでるのはらしくない！\nキュートな笑顔の美少女こそが、茜ちゃんだもんね♪", "zh": "话说回来，一直消沉下去可不像我！可爱的笑容美少女才是小茜嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2006_p", "source_sha256": "209912003e6586c262bd0d9b95523a25dd202cce7ef153bbd7105f4d8f08cbd1", "ja": "ああ。やっぱり茜はそうでなくちゃ！", "zh": "啊。茜果然就该是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2007_023aka", "source_sha256": "a691eefe9061242e8cda77f08acf14e47c3ea2dfac4d9f2da363d0e937bdceba", "ja": "当然だよ{$P$}ちゃん！\nこの茜ちゃん、いつまでも落ち込んだ顔は……はっ！？", "zh": "那是当然的啦，小{$P$}！\n身为你茜小茜，可不能一直摆着消沉的脸……哈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2008_p", "source_sha256": "7cea493865736820b7d34baf61161e5afa6bcddecaab3ea9b63c9e2369fb656c", "ja": "ん？　どうした、茜？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2009_023aka", "source_sha256": "0cb3af649cae39e0f94ec917f38a77d1d9f270ff10249b04624646f5b91d8979", "ja": "あ～、やっぱり茜ちゃん、まだまだ落ち込んでるかも！\nはぁ、失敗しちゃってショックだなぁ……。", "zh": "啊～，果然小茜还是没能彻底振作起来啊！唉，失败了，真受打击啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2010_023aka", "source_sha256": "83c0a529f36f1cd09398dcd4b2c32f3a221077bfc3e6b172e48aab37d82a4363", "ja": "まだまだ{$P$}ちゃんに慰めて欲しい\nなー。ナデナデして、甘やかして欲しいなー。チラッ。", "zh": "茜还很想被{$P$}安慰\n呢～想被摸摸头、被狠狠宠爱一番呢～（偷瞄）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2011_p", "source_sha256": "e6570c7e485544ff6454360dee2589c9b3df956fa457f372143c830330376969", "ja": "全く、しょうがないな。\n……今日だけだぞ？", "zh": "真是的，拿你没办法。\n……只限今天哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0473_2012_023aka", "source_sha256": "0dc10445ec9367abaf6eccc676fc9391be97b5602e88faa3ab3ee561093d0297", "ja": "さすが、話がわかるぅ！\nありがとね、{$P$}ちゃん。えへへ♪", "zh": "不愧是你，真懂我～！\n谢谢你，{$P$}，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
